While I'm not completely clear on what causes this issue, you can set that option on two other ways:

1. via `searchParameters`: https://codesandbox.io/s/j26wz0r6jw

```js
const search = instantsearch({
  appId: 'latency',
  apiKey: '6be0576ff61c053d5f9a3225e2a90f76',
  indexName: 'instant_search',
  searchParameters: {
    hitsPerPage: 8,
    aroundRadius: 75000,
  },
});
```

2. via the `configure` widget: https://codesandbox.io/s/w6pjxo5kjk

```js
const search = instantsearch({
  appId: 'latency',
  apiKey: '6be0576ff61c053d5f9a3225e2a90f76',
  indexName: 'instant_search',
});

search.addWidget(
  instantsearch.widgets.configure({
    hitsPerPage: 8,
    aroundRadius: 75000,
  })
);
```
